Zotero 10.0.2 compatibility with Firefox ESR153.

Backported from the following upstream commits, in order:
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/242bbccda5669638169b5baa18c154d1f50f4bed
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/408179ad090205d69acebe611dd7f44530ce6477 fx153: Anchor the actor-removal patterns in ActorManagerParent
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/06848ce17f269e96c8249287971a30293f9f7742 fx153: Update about:addons patches for the ES module split
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/d701c43862b6375e2b16812152b40e09fa8b637d fx153: Restore autocomplete popup sizing from the anchor element
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/c192127ab13e253a580af59651fd3b799c51d727 fx153: Take over <search-textbox>, removed from Firefox
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/b7232f130f0e87877bd2cc7e80b3574103a2a7bf fx153: Don't remove the Pocket actor, removed from Firefox
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/14b43c9559a76600c15cfce2b4536f1f3e8ee98c fx153: Disable Firefox's baseline CSP for chrome: documents
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/1c005c7e2147db19ebb578d2799d1a5903f59e39 fx153: Re-enable chrome: DTD loading
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/3bb3b4f2c9ff8da62b8681360e6921bf9eb9f057 fx153: Move off the removed synchronous nsILoginManager methods
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/5ea624338440a7a5f1994b4c2f96a1fb8fb97248 fx153: ownerGlobal -> documentGlobal
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/bca6537e6def3e8bf42758e7b3daf3f3d50c80aa fx153: Allow eval() in the parent process
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/eac3838f00094c7cff050aecaf09f936a2c8f582 fx153: Use ChromeUtils.predictRemoteTypeForURI() in HiddenBrowser
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/bcd8ad20ec1a484d715a2e447eed6b0ca779d276 fx153: Use command events for checkbox changes
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/f245f5c2b26dbf5c313073e4c9a3040b5a2cf807 fx153: Set XUL checked/disabled as boolean attributes
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/567cc2d43abe04815a40a32f592d5dedab4be64e fx153: Set XUL hidden/collapsed as boolean attributes
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/6fbe5e4135eb836c36ee18daa5fcf5ac8ac5e0c2 fx153: Match XUL boolean attributes in selectors without a value
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/a32dd2b95928183491c29da0c755a06820e75271 fx153: Don't freeze built-ins in the translation sandbox
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/01b7d0667ce2af87d5781a02021b7b28a4b1d01c fx153: Move to nsIPKCS11Token for the NSS key database
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/45e38322e17fef6b2b977aff17641aaaf8c3eb63 fx153: Keep backup-constants.mjs
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/78d21617af252d79daac8e4baa4930be1895eb1b fx153: Hide the about:addons sidebar
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/503bb03aec5cf663c327cc3e049834bced6da243 fx153: Hide the native clear button in search fields
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/030cd3dc5e758a73f2591460f62dd3b4e6511ad7 fx153: Drop the hover background on native search clear buttons
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/35a70117b00729f41b5647a1634185c93e8dfda3 fx153: Restore the toolbarbutton dropmarker
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/b5ceb6fa650c91c7059fe69ecd32117044182725 fx153: Don't assign oncommand attribute strings to .oncommand
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/300305a9fb89b237d2f7bd6057a70fb4b32bedb7 fx153: Set menu icons via --menuitem-icon for in-content menus
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/adc5648d296479911c69384d74ac6fcbb4f640d8 fx153: Restore pass-through clicks on toolbarbutton dropmarkers
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/aaeb9c6c9a021b110d1cd009ab9581a369b3471c fx153: Don't bundle unused Firefox runtime files
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/09249bfb7307b181b6eb0eaa12c0a90f53f289dc fx153: Interface should load with nsIID instead of string (#6008)
https://github.com/zotero/zotero/commit/f53d4b5eca8ecb24be622212f0880a69da245ead fx153: Fix update window getting stuck on "Looking for changes"

Adaptations for the 10.0.2 release branch:
- Preserve its credential fallback flow while awaiting the ESR153 login APIs.
- Adapt the HiddenBrowser hunk to the existing comment/context.
- Keep macOS/Windows runtime packaging and WebGPU defaults unchanged; set Linux Gecko to 153.3.0esr.
- Require Gecko 153 in application.ini.
- Add a saved-snapshot rendering regression test for the reader iframe migration.

